      "value": "There are many crasher avatars out there, using different technologies to annoy users.\n\nAs a first line of deffence, you setup a custom shieldlevel to block almost everything for non-friend accounts.\n\nLike Animations, Shaders, Sounds and such.\n\nMaybe even the Avatar itself.\n\nWithout the Animations and Shaders its almost impossible to crash someone.\n\nThe only thing would be sending invalid commands via the network. This is where VRC Needs more validation.\n\nIf the instance is Crashed erverone inside will lose thier connection aswell.\n\nIf you want more moderation, make a own group and only use your own group public instances and group ban the attackers. At some point they will run out of accounts or can't even enter with thier current.",
